{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02397",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.98,
      "end_seconds": 4.08,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Hi doctor, am I too early?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.03,
      "end_seconds": 8.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "Come in. Please sit. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.09,
      "end_seconds": 17.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.69,
      "text": "Yeah, it's pain in my back and hips. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.91,
      "end_seconds": 22.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "What's the timeline, when did it begin?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 23.13,
      "end_seconds": 29.4,
      "duration_seconds": 6.27,
      "text": "I, I'd say six months. Actually, no, closer to about three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.25,
      "end_seconds": 39.52,
      "duration_seconds": 9.27,
      "text": "Tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.6,
      "end_seconds": 58.07,
      "duration_seconds": 16.47,
      "text": "Honestly, on and off. I'd give it a five, out of ten. Oh, and being very tired. Oh, and constipation. That's been about the same, six months. About constipation, severe, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 75.05,
      "end_seconds": 77.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 78.4,
      "end_seconds": 96.06,
      "duration_seconds": 17.66,
      "text": "I quit smoking around ten years ago. Nothing, I'm teetotal. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I hardly move around during the day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.46,
      "end_seconds": 101.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Do you react to any medicines or foods? Any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.83,
      "end_seconds": 105.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.87,
      "text": "Not to my knowledge, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 118.26,
      "end_seconds": 125.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.46,
      "text": "Alright, are you taking anything regularly, including from the pharmacy? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 126.24,
      "end_seconds": 132.21,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "I take something called warf... warfarin, 3 milligrams, maybe, in the evening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 132.99,
      "end_seconds": 137.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.2,
      "end_seconds": 145.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.53,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Morphine liquid, 5 milligrams, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.46,
      "end_seconds": 148.09,
      "duration_seconds": 1.63,
      "text": "And for how long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.83,
      "end_seconds": 151.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.5,
      "text": "About two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 152.23,
      "end_seconds": 155.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Anything in your past medical history I should know?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 158.41,
      "end_seconds": 161.06,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "I have an irregular heartbeat."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 162.25,
      "end_seconds": 164.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "Has there been any bleeding?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 166.29,
      "end_seconds": 167.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "No. No bleeding."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.53,
      "end_seconds": 172.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.95,
      "text": "Any shortness of breath, vomiting or confusion?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.95,
      "end_seconds": 178.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.09,
      "text": "No, no shortness of breath, vomiting or confusion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.14,
      "end_seconds": 182.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Is your chest okay generally?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.9,
      "end_seconds": 185.89,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "No problems with breathing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 187.42,
      "end_seconds": 192.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Right, any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.7,
      "end_seconds": 195.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "Oh, no weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 202.89,
      "end_seconds": 206.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 217.99,
      "end_seconds": 220.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.01,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 235.57,
      "end_seconds": 240.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "Okay: temperature 36.9, heart rate 65, pressure 125 over 72."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.91,
      "end_seconds": 243.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "Is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.67,
      "end_seconds": 247.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.56,
      "text": "I'll interpret them after the examination."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 249.89,
      "end_seconds": 254.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 256.28,
      "end_seconds": 257.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "Breathe out slowly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.34,
      "end_seconds": 271.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and you look comfortable and thin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.4,
      "end_seconds": 287.98,
      "duration_seconds": 12.58,
      "text": "Alright, thank you, you can get dressed. Taking everything into account, I'd lean towards cancer pain needing better control. I'd also keep opioid-induced constipation in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 291.02,
      "end_seconds": 293.14,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 296.74,
      "end_seconds": 325.94,
      "duration_seconds": 29.2,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's cancer pain needing better control, and we'll watch how it goes. We'll begin with morphine sulfate modified-release, 20 milligrams, twice a day, long term. You take it by mouth. It's for cancer pain. Let's use senna, 15 milligrams, at night, long term. That should help with opioid-induced constipation. Take the long-acting tablet regularly and the liquid for breakthrough pain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.72,
      "end_seconds": 344.76,
      "duration_seconds": 14.04,
      "text": "If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. I think the palliative care team should see you too."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 346.12,
      "end_seconds": 348.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Sure, where do I go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 350.55,
      "end_seconds": 358.63,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.37,
      "end_seconds": 363.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "I know what to watch for."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 364.62,
      "end_seconds": 371.88,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "I'll want another look in one week. Alright, I think we're done unless you have questions."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.76,
      "end_seconds": 375.57,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 376.21,
      "end_seconds": 377.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.27,
      "text": "Look after yourself."
    }
  ]
}